{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First and foremost, this is an exceptionally content-rich game that seamlessly integrates three entirely distinct gameplay modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In \u200bSurvivor Mode, players can choose from nearly \u200b220 distinct skills to create exhilarating combat combinations, paired with approximately \u200b100,000 affixes that deliver a loot-driven experience rivaling Diablo's signature itemization depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc00-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc01-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc02-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u200bAuto Chess Mode revolutionizes tactical gameplay with \u200b70 innovative skill sets (totaling 280 abilities), enabling \u200bthousands of character-specific synergies. Enhanced by deep equipment customization and affix systems, this mode achieves unprecedented strategic variety \u2013 our ultimate ambition is to craft a competitive experience on par with Teamfight Tactics (TFT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc03-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc04-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode offers world exploration, character development, dungeon crawling, loot farming, and craftable legendary gear \u2013 all woven into a cohesive RPG journey. In this mode, delivering a true-to-tabletop experience is where developer efforts are focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc05-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc06-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an indie game, it is of high quality and definitely worth owning.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2401740?t=1745322801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2401740?t=1745322801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/01efa281cfd5402b5d1e50e9f9c833bc3e4946d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745322801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/01efa281cfd5402b5d1e50e9f9c833bc3e4946d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745322801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3668610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First and foremost, this is an exceptionally content-rich game that seamlessly integrates three entirely distinct gameplay modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In \u200bSurvivor Mode, players can choose from nearly \u200b220 distinct skills to create exhilarating combat combinations, paired with approximately \u200b100,000 affixes that deliver a loot-driven experience rivaling Diablo's signature itemization depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc00-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc01-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc02-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u200bAuto Chess Mode revolutionizes tactical gameplay with \u200b70 innovative skill sets (totaling 280 abilities), enabling \u200bthousands of character-specific synergies. Enhanced by deep equipment customization and affix systems, this mode achieves unprecedented strategic variety \u2013 our ultimate ambition is to craft a competitive experience on par with Teamfight Tactics (TFT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc03-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc04-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode offers world exploration, character development, dungeon crawling, loot farming, and craftable legendary gear \u2013 all woven into a cohesive RPG journey. In this mode, delivering a true-to-tabletop experience is where developer efforts are focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc05-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/Desc06-E.jpg?t=1745322801\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an indie game, it is of high quality and definitely worth owning.</p>","developers":["VoidStudio"],"genres":[{"de